{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1789742128000-97e45b", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "企微通讯录里有两个部门显示重复了，怎么排查？", "id": "294a980f88da411eac0d5dd3ce7a60a6", "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:35:28", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "5a19b02113144eb6aeea2a3465228bf2", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:35:28", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "080f83b6ed7d42b7b8e265d519a235bd", "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:35:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-18T14:36:08"}, {"type": "text", "text": "排查顺序：\n1. 管理后台 → 通讯录 → 部门列表，看是否同一部门建了两次（常见于曾改名后重新创建）；\n2. 若由同步触发，检查同步任务的部门映射 ID 是否新旧并存；\n3. 把空部门或旧部门先「停用」观察 1 天再删除，避免员工归属悬空。", "id": "c78ea44cb1584ab58188d6dfcd9a2652", "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:35:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-18T14:36:08"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "7d810fdb9fe54800b2c98adbaf6fc994", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:35:36", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-18T14:36:08", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "删除部门会把员工也删掉吗？", "id": "51033f998642404cb31de4eedf5aa301", "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:38:28", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "805eb5be039241d0a2a75fa172420b95", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:38:28", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "61ed4f6b92e04006a2865f565c362e24", "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:38:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-18T14:39:08"}, {"type": "text", "text": "企微删除部门时，若部门下还有成员会禁止删除；先把成员批量转移到正确部门，再删空部门即安全。删除前建议导出一份成员名单备份。", "id": "36384649b98149a094e577210d9f633e", "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:38:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-18T14:39:08"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "c9e21ef2730942cf97dd48ca8a2a658b", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:38:36", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-18T14:39:08", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "月报里加班时数单独列吗？", "id": "4c2c14a49bf241a187b02a3efb193dfd", "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:41:08", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "abc4eb0e254443979cf9444428355b9a", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:41:08", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "16f9b410f40e4905af1140e094286182", "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:41:14", "finished_at": "2026-09-18T14:41:53"}, {"type": "text", "text": "单独列，而且要拆「审批内加班」和「事后补报」两栏；连续两月加班超 36 小时的人系统自动标红，人事约谈部门负责人，这是劳动监察重点。", "id": "146a362954e942b386f5cab7edc4a2f2", "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:41:14", "finished_at": "2026-09-18T14:41:53"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "5cadbc6f802243ef9a0267ebb6203f87", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T14:41:14", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-18T14:41:53", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}